#. {ph1}: </strong >
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:479
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA returns {ph0}the clock conversion, default settings and generating "
"methods.{ph1} The constructors set a 30-second interval and six digits; the "
"timestamp method turns seconds into a block number."
msgstr ""
"REA zwraca {ph0}konwersja zegara, ustawienia domyślne i metody "
"generowania.{ph1} Konstruktorzy ustawiają 30-sekundowy interwał i sześć "
"cyfr; metoda znacznika czasu zamienia sekundy na numer bloku."

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:494
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}01{ph1} Time block"
msgstr "{ph0}01{ph1} Blok czasu"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:502
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}02{ph1} Key + block"
msgstr "{ph0}02{ph1} Klucz + blok"

#. {ph0}: <span>
#. {ph1}: </span>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:510
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}03{ph1} Six digits"
msgstr "{ph0}03{ph1} Sześć cyfr"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:569
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Time chooses the block.{ph1} Seconds 30 through 59 all give block 1. At"
" 60 seconds, the block becomes 2."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Czas wybiera blok.{ph1} Sekundy od 30 do 59 dają blok 1. Po 60 "
"sekundach blok staje się 2."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:575
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}The key matters too.{ph1} The generator combines the account key with "
"the block. An account with a different key can show a different code at the "
"same time."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Kluczowe sprawy też.{ph1} Generator łączy klucz konta z blokiem. Konto "
"z innym kluczem może wyświetlać jednocześnie inny kod."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/showcase/aegis/index.html:582
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/aegis/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Keep six digits.{ph1} The remainder after division by 1,000,000 is "
"padded with zeroes when needed, so a code can begin with 0."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Zachowaj sześć cyfr.{ph1} Reszta po podzieleniu przez 1 000 000 jest "
"uzupełniana zerami w razie potrzeby, więc kod może zaczynać się od 0."

